                 ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────╮
                 │                                             │
                 │ e                 Edit / definition         │
                 │ Delete d          Delete                    │
                 │ Ctrl+S            Save                      │
                 │ F1                Connection list           │
                 │ K                 Kubernetes clusters       │
                 │ Ctrl+T            Next theme                │
                 │ F12               Event log                 │
                 │ Space             Command menu              │
                 │ ? F2              Show keys                 │
                 │ Esc               Back / close              │
                 │ q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
                 │ Enter             Select / new line         │
                 │ ↑                 Up                        │
                 │ ↓                 Down                      │
                 │ ←                 Left / previous column    │
                 │ →                 Right / next column       │
                 │ PgUp              Page up                   │
                 │ PgDn              Page down                 │
                 │ Home              First row / line start    │
                 │ …                 Last row / line end       │
